  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening global food safety through improved regional and country food control systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will: support institutional and technical capacities for food control and improve performance of public and regulatory bodies in food safety/quality; strengthen systems to identify, prevent and response to emerging as well as recurring food safety risks; support value chain operators in key sectors  to comply with relevant market requirements;  and promote the risk analysis framework for evidence-informed food safety decision making</narrative>
  </description>
